  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1110.04 Archery and Muzzleloader. In addition to the agent fee required by RSA 214-A:4, I:\n\n(a) The fee for an archery license, pursuant to RSA 208:5, I, shall be shall be $31 for residents and $82 for nonresidents; and\n\n(b) The fee for a muzzleloader license, pursuant to RSA 208:5-a, shall be shall be $15 for residents and $40 for nonresidents.\n\nSource. #10874, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-1-15, EXPIRED: 12-28-15\n\nNew. #10981, eff 1-1-16; ss by #13874, eff 2-23-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis1100.html"
